  "method": "Replay existing fixed-threshold component hit records. No new predictions, fitting, speed relabeling or model execution. Half-open early periods: frame<40 or frame<60.",
  "limitations": [
    "The same function is applied to each window, but this does not rule out a window-scheme effect.",
    "models.py:66-77 uses separate learned T\u00d7T temporal matrices and output-position biases; there is no constraint enforcing temporal shift equivariance.",
    "infer.py:38-46 shifts the final window; infer.py:63 max-fuses overlapping windows. Frames differ in context, relative position and number of scoring opportunities.",
    "The single-coverage phase table excludes overlaps to make position unique. It is descriptive and confounded with clip position, clip identity and target composition.",
    "No per-window logits were retained; for overlaps the winning window cannot be identified from the fused predictions. An offset/context intervention is required to test causation.",
    "Shared-track, isolated-target and category claims were not independently recomputed here.",
    "Early windows with many repeated frames/targets are not independent statistical samples."
  ],
